Colour themes
=============

The built-in terminal themes reproduce the colour palettes of these projects, each under the MIT licence:
Catppuccin (catppuccin.com), Tokyo Night (github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme), Gruvbox
(github.com/morhetz/gruvbox), Solarized (ethanschoonover.com/solarized), Rosé Pine (rosepinetheme.com),
Dracula (draculatheme.com) and Nord (nordtheme.com). Each theme's credit is also shown in Settings.


Services
========

When "Real weather" is turned on in Settings › Meadow, the app asks Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com) for the
weather at your location, rounded to about a kilometre. The app makes no other network requests of its
own: Claude Code's hook events reach it on this Mac only (127.0.0.1).
